## SQ-UC-01 | Upgrade Aquatic coral growths parse
@group B
@commands Boot; grep latest.log for `block_growths`, `ua_`, `upgrade_aquatic:`, `Failed to` near IW's load lines
@pass IW's `Loaded N block growths` count is 11 higher than the boot before; no parse error naming a `ua_` file
@fails A block id or property in the template does not exist on UA's block: check the error's block name against the UA jar's blockstates
@from batches/r1031/a1_boot.qb
bootexpect Loaded \d+ block growths
bootreject (?i)(failed|error).*(ua_[a-z_]*coral|upgrade_aquatic:)
look the "Loaded N block growths" count is 11 higher than a pre-10-28 boot (perf/sessions/q1028 boots)

## SQ-UC-02 | acan coral grows in a warm ocean, dead one does not
@phase worldgen
@group B
@commands `/locate biome minecraft:warm_ocean`, tp there; fill a 7x5x7 water box, `/setblock` `upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_block` in the middle, `upgrade_aquatic:dead_acan_coral_block` 3 blocks away; `/gamerule randomTickSpeed 1000` 120 s, then 3
@pass Acan wall fans on the live block's sides and acan fans or acan coral on top (an occasional wet sponge); nothing around the dead block
@fails Nothing grows: run `/reload` and repeat; still nothing: check the IW fast path (SQ-IWF-01) and `block_growth_blacklist`
@from batches/r1031/b1_gameplay.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> execute positioned 0 70 0 run locate biome minecraft:warm_ocean
waitlog nearest minecraft:warm_ocean is at 300
capture WO is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> tp qa {WO1} 70 {WO3}
sleep 15
> fill {WO1-8} 54 {WO3-3} {WO1+14} 60 {WO3+3} minecraft:water
> setblock {WO1-6} 57 {WO3} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_block
> setblock {WO1-3} 57 {WO3} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_block
> setblock {WO1} 57 {WO3} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_block
> setblock {WO1+3} 57 {WO3} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_block
> setblock {WO1+6} 57 {WO3} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_block
> setblock {WO1+12} 57 {WO3} upgrade_aquatic:dead_acan_coral_block
> cdevtest randomtick {WO1-8} 54 {WO3-3} {WO1+14} 60 {WO3+3} 1170 nofluids
> cdevtest count {WO1-7} 56 {WO3-1} {WO1+7} 58 {WO3+1} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_wall_fan
> cdevtest count {WO1-7} 56 {WO3-1} {WO1+7} 58 {WO3+1} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_fan
> cdevtest count {WO1-7} 56 {WO3-1} {WO1+7} 58 {WO3+1} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral
> cdevtest count {WO1-7} 56 {WO3-1} {WO1+7} 58 {WO3+1} minecraft:wet_sponge
> cdevtest count {WO1+11} 56 {WO3-1} {WO1+13} 58 {WO3+1} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_wall_fan
> cdevtest count {WO1+11} 56 {WO3-1} {WO1+13} 58 {WO3+1} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_fan
> cdevtest count {WO1+11} 56 {WO3-1} {WO1+13} 58 {WO3+1} upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral
look counts 1-4 above 0 in total (about 2.9 growths expected); counts 5-7 all 0
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ .*error=
look 1170 random ticks per block = 240 s at randomTickSpeed 1000

## SQ-UC-03 | prismarine coral grows in a cold ocean; elder prismarine and acan do not
@phase worldgen
@group B
@commands Same box in a `minecraft:cold_ocean`: one `upgrade_aquatic:prismarine_coral_block`, one `upgrade_aquatic:elder_prismarine_coral_block`, one `upgrade_aquatic:acan_coral_block`; `randomTickSpeed 1000` 120 s, then 3
@pass Prismarine fans / coral around the prismarine block; nothing around the elder prismarine or acan block
@fails Prismarine silent: the `#minecraft:is_ocean` tag string is not read by IW's `biome_match`; acan grows: the warm ocean predicate is missing
@from batches/r1031/b1_gameplay.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
